{"title":"생명의 유스티티아","artist":"Neru","sourceId":"reference:bxLf86ciNPstpAQOuoFj","sourceHash":"92ff0dc1f785b98da5891df11cfe3aa505b45eb167625a9f8a75bae832fe61e3","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":26006967,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.97,"end":2.61,"text":"Justice is still in my heart","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":2.61,"end":19.56,"text":"君に届け ユースティティア","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":19.56,"end":24.98,"text":"暗闇が立ち込めた様な 見捨てられた街で","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":24.98,"end":31.79,"text":"一人 孤独を詠う君を見た","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":31.79,"end":37.28,"text":"よみがえる過去（きおく）に木霊（こだま）して 君の腕を掴む","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":37.28,"end":43.2,"text":"ここが 約束の地だと信じて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":43.2,"end":49.53,"text":"確かな答えは何処にも無いけれど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":49.53,"end":55.51,"text":"籠の中の小鳥は目覚めた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":55.51,"end":61.71,"text":"羽根さえ無いまま鼓動は加速して","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":61.71,"end":71.78,"text":"僕らこの日を この時を待ち続けてたんだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":71.78,"end":74.8,"text":"叶わぬ祈りに 救いの両手を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":74.8,"end":78.35,"text":"生まれ変われ 命のユースティティア","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":78.35,"end":81.45,"text":"どんな風 吹いていたって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":81.45,"end":84.05,"text":"この声は 消せやしない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":84.05,"end":87.15,"text":"未来（あした）の僕らに 残せる物は何？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":87.15,"end":90.48,"text":"宙（そら）を照らせ 一縷（いちる）のユースティティア","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":90.48,"end":93.12,"text":"一秒だって 狂わせない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":93.12,"end":99.42,"text":"奪われた世界を さぁ 取り戻せ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":99.42,"end":102.43,"text":"重なり合って いつの日だって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":102.43,"end":117.88,"text":"僕らは共にいる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":117.88,"end":123.33,"text":"錆び付いた扉に手翳して 再び描く現在（いま）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":123.33,"end":129.8,"text":"君の 君だけの物語（うた）が始まる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":129.8,"end":135.82,"text":"失くした言葉と言葉の意味を紡ぎ合わせて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":135.82,"end":142.53,"text":"強く 誰より力強く 咲き誇るその音（ね）を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":142.53,"end":173.38,"text":"どうか 絶やさないで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":173.38,"end":179.47,"text":"僕が僕らしく在ること 君が君らしく在ること","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":179.47,"end":185.75,"text":"それが果てしない僕らの ユースティティア","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":185.75,"end":188.69,"text":"叶わぬ祈りに 救いの両手を","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":188.69,"end":192.03,"text":"生まれ変われ 命のユースティティア","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":192.03,"end":195.27,"text":"どんな風 吹いていたって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":195.27,"end":197.96,"text":"この声は 消せやしない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":197.96,"end":200.95,"text":"未来（あした）の僕らに 残せる物は何？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":200.95,"end":204.32999999999998,"text":"宙（そら）を照らせ 一縷（いちる）のユースティティア","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":204.32999999999998,"end":207.05,"text":"一秒だって 狂わせない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":207.05,"end":213.24,"text":"奪われた世界を さぁ 取り戻せ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":213.24,"end":216.3,"text":"偽り合って 騙されたって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":216.3,"end":219.46,"text":"それでもそっと 光は降って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":219.46,"end":222.67000000000002,"text":"いつかはきっと 必ずきっと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":222.67000000000002,"end":228.91,"text":"僕が君の心 燈（とも）すから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}